    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this 2/3 mid-terraced 2-storey residence, located within walking distances of all amenities in the popular village of Clonlara & located only 10kms from Limerick City & Suburbs - Presented to the market in pristine turn-key condition, the property represents an ideal family home for the would-be purchaser - Early viewing strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "To Include - Entrance Hall, Lounge, Kitchen/Dining Area, Family Shower Room, 3 Bedrooms, Attic Storage Room with Shower Room."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.73m x 1.79m \r\nCeramic tiled floor. Carpeted stairs to first floor. Dado rail & coving.\r\n\r\nLounge - 4.97m x 3.45m \r\n+2.38m. x 1.46m. Pine timber floor & feature tiled floor in bay window. Wood-burning stove in cast iron surround fireplace with granite hearth. Coving & ceiling rose. Recessed lighting. TV point. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area - 5.61m x 5.11m \r\n\r\n\r\nDining Area - \r\nIncluded Above. Pine timber floor. Wainscotting feature. Coving. Fully shelved hot press located here also.\r\n\r\nKitchen - \r\nIncluded Above. Ceramic tiled floor. Fully fitted kitchen units to include Kenwood range cooker, extractor & breakfast counter. Plumbed for dishwasher. Over-counter tiling. Wainscotting feature. Sliding PVC door to rear patio & garden area. \r\n\r\nLanding - 2.68m x 0.94m \r\nCarpeted. Coving. Wainscotting feature. Wall light.\r\n\r\nFamily Shower Room. - 2.55m x 1.64m \r\nNewly upgraded. Wall & floor tiled. Large rain-forest shower off mains, WC & WHB. Revolving mirrored storage cabinet. Recessed lighting. Radiator towel rail. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.43m x 3.33m \r\nLaminated timber floor. Wall-to-wall built-in wardrobes. Wall shelving. Coving. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom 2 - 3.9m x 2.69m \r\nCarpeted. 3-door built-in wardrobes. Wall shelving. Dado rail. Coving.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3/Walk-in Wardrobe - 2.91m x 2.57m \r\nCarpeted. Wall-to-wall built-in wardrobes. Carpeted stairs to Attic Storage Room. Recessed lighting. \r\n\r\nAttic Storage Room - 4.85m x 3.74m \r\nCarpeted. Recessed lighting. Overhead Velux window allowing natural light through. Access to side storage attic space. Electric wall heater.\r\n\r\nShower Room - \r\nIncluded Above. Ceramic tiled floor & fully tiled around shower area. Electric shower, WC & WHB.\r\n\r\nGarden/Storage Shed - 3.74m x 3.55m \r\nPlumbed for washing machine. Dual aspect windows. Electricity supply.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Services - To include - Oil fired central heating (Boiler upgraded in 2025). Mains water & sewerage. \r\nPVC double glazed windows & upgraded front entrance door. \r\nEnclosed maintenance-free rear garden with block-built storage shed & pedestrian access from rear laneway. Large cobblelock driveway with wrought iron entrance gates & off-road parking. \r\nBuilt in 1983. Overlooks large green area.\r\nLocated very close to local primary school & Clonlara GAA Club."
      },
      {
